  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4108.01 Methods of Demonstrating Compliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4108.01 Methods of Demonstrating Compliance. Compliance with the requirements of this chapter shall be demonstrated by:\n\n(a) Testing the product as specified in Env-A 4108.02(a); or\n\n(b) Calculating the VOC content of the product as specified in Env-A 4108.04, based on the records required by Env-A 4108.03.\n\nSource. #10527, eff 2-26-14; ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4100.html"
